    "reason": "[ev-07d67e9be26a] says an environment is exposed when status.storedVersions of any of the four external-secrets CRDs contains v1alpha1, and [ev-4a1f27e04efd], [ev-f978a29a8906] and [ev-04b0055709ca] show that 0.16.0 drops the v1alpha1 version. The proposal's any-of-four-CRDs structure is right, but it uses a text-line leaf. text-line is for lines of embedded text such as ConfigMap data, while storedVersions is a string array. The leaf should be a field check that some element of status.storedVersions[] equals v1alpha1.",
